  <name xml:lang="ko">믹믹</name>
  <summary>All-in-one screen capture, image editor and design tools</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="ko">화면 캡처, 이미지 편집, 디자인 도구를 한 곳에서</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      MikMick is a free and open source screen capture tool for Linux with a ribbon style image
      editor and handy design tools such as a color picker, color palette, magnifier, ruler,
      crosshair, protractor and an on-screen presentation (whiteboard) tool.
    </p>
  </description>
